      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Bump - This still isn't resolved, I tested this in multiple scenes with multiple avatars, in multiple unity projects, with multiple versions of the SDK. This has to be a problem with the client.\nONCE AGAIN- THE VRC_Spatial Audio Source COMPONENT DOES NOT CHANGE THIS BUG IN ANY WAY.\nFix this crap- it wasn't this way 2 months ago.",
