  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-05-07T07:32:24.179Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Some update broke the Spatial Blend curve, it worked fine about a month ago. Nothing was changed nor updated on the models I tested- the curve is ignored and the first node value is used as a constant rather than using the curve.\nThe audio volume curve isn't affected, just the Spatial Blend.\nAny modification of VRC_Spatial Audio Source doesn't change the situation, even upon removal of the component. Some update broke this widely used function.\nFix this please so ~40% of models aren't permanently messy\n(edited by mod to remove inappropriate language)",
